1
00:00:10,012 --> 00:00:18,857
Akwaaba! Welcome to EduNexa, the complete management system for Bright Future International School — from Creche all the way to Diploma.

2
00:00:19,007 --> 00:00:28,184
Everyone signs in to their own portal: administrators, teachers, parents, students, the accountant, librarian, storekeeper, transport officer, canteen manager and support staff.

3
00:00:28,334 --> 00:00:37,500
In demo mode you can open any portal with one click. Each portal shows only what that person is allowed to see.

4
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:45,389
A school can switch on secure sign-in, with a password and a verification code sent to the phone.

5
00:00:45,539 --> 00:00:53,277
Staff use their email or phone, students use their admission number, and parents can create their own account.

6
00:00:53,427 --> 00:01:00,450
Let's go back and open the Administrator portal.

7
00:01:04,869 --> 00:01:12,668
This is the head's dashboard. At a glance: enrolment, staff, fees collected this term, and fees still outstanding.

8
00:01:12,818 --> 00:01:20,925
The Needs attention panel flags what matters today — gate arrivals, low stock, overdue library books and pending leave.

9
00:01:21,075 --> 00:01:27,822
Charts show income against expenditure, enrolment by section and the attendance trend.

10
00:01:27,972 --> 00:01:34,997
The menu on the left groups every module. On a phone it becomes a bottom bar.

11
00:01:35,147 --> 00:01:42,580
Search finds any student, staff member or page instantly. Press Control K from anywhere.

12
00:01:42,730 --> 00:01:52,450
And there is a dark mode for evening work.

13
00:01:58,146 --> 00:02:04,127
Admissions tracks every applicant from application, to entrance exam, interview, offer and enrolment.

14
00:02:04,277 --> 00:02:13,315
For an applicant who has been offered a place, you can print a formal admission letter with the fees to pay.

15
00:02:13,465 --> 00:02:23,599
One click on Enrol creates the student, the parent record and the first fee bill together.

16
00:02:23,749 --> 00:02:28,250
And here is the new student, ready in the system.

17
00:02:34,246 --> 00:02:41,293
The Students page lists every learner. Filter by section, class or status, or export to Excel.

18
00:02:41,443 --> 00:02:51,817
Let's open Kofi Mensah in JHS 2.

19
00:02:51,967 --> 00:02:59,363
His profile brings everything together: personal details, parent contacts, medical notes, results, attendance, fees, library and conduct.

20
00:02:59,513 --> 00:03:07,610
To add a photo, tap the camera button. You can upload a picture or take one with the camera.

21
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:16,293
Drag and zoom to frame the face, then save.

22
00:03:16,443 --> 00:03:24,109
The photo now appears on his ID card, report card, gate badge and everywhere he is listed.

23
00:03:24,259 --> 00:03:33,250
The tabs show his academic results, attendance record and fee statement.

24
00:03:38,042 --> 00:03:44,701
Staff and HR keeps every teacher and worker, with roles, qualifications, leave requests and approvals.

25
00:03:44,851 --> 00:03:54,084
Each staff member has a profile with their teaching load, pay and a printable staff ID card.

26
00:03:54,234 --> 00:04:00,891
Payroll calculates salaries every month with Ghana SSNIT and PAYE deductions, ready for the bank.

27
00:04:01,041 --> 00:04:06,090
Click any line to print a payslip.

28
00:04:10,412 --> 00:04:16,347
Classes are organised by section: Early Years, Primary, JHS, SHS programmes and Diploma.

29
00:04:16,497 --> 00:04:24,354
Open a class to see its subjects, the teacher for each one, and the students.

30
00:04:24,504 --> 00:04:33,130
The timetable shows the whole week for any class, with breaks and lunch. The administrator can edit it here.

31
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:43,095
Teachers take the daily register in seconds. Mark everyone present with one tap…

32
00:04:43,245 --> 00:04:47,382
…then change anyone who is late or absent.

33
00:04:47,532 --> 00:04:55,690
Save the register, and with one more tap, parents of absent children receive a text message.

34
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:06,837
In the gradebook, teachers enter class scores out of thirty and exam scores out of seventy.

35
00:05:06,987 --> 00:05:16,928
Totals, grades and positions are calculated automatically, using the GES, WASSCE or Diploma grading scale.

36
00:05:17,078 --> 00:05:24,454
Report cards are generated for the whole class, ranked, with remarks and the BECE aggregate for JHS.

37
00:05:24,604 --> 00:05:30,650
Open one to print it, or print the whole class at once.

38
00:05:34,494 --> 00:05:41,509
The learning platform lets teachers post lesson notes, slides, worksheets and video links for each class.

39
00:05:41,659 --> 00:05:47,573
Assignments show who has submitted and what still needs marking.

40
00:05:47,723 --> 00:05:52,730
And quizzes mark themselves the moment a student submits.

41
00:05:55,554 --> 00:06:03,022
This is the accountant's portal: money billed and collected this term, arrears and expenses.

42
00:06:03,172 --> 00:06:09,108
Fees and Finance holds every invoice, payment, arrears list, fee structure and expense.

43
00:06:09,258 --> 00:06:17,223
Recording a payment takes seconds — Mobile Money, cash, bank transfer or cheque.

44
00:06:17,373 --> 00:06:23,931
Save it, and an official receipt is ready to print or share.

45
00:06:24,081 --> 00:06:31,730
The Arrears tab lists everyone who owes, with one-tap SMS reminders to parents.

46
00:06:36,149 --> 00:06:44,968
The canteen manager sells food from a simple point of sale — jollof, waakye, banku and tilapia, kelewele, sobolo and more.

47
00:06:45,118 --> 00:06:54,447
Tap items to add them to the order…

48
00:06:54,597 --> 00:07:03,480
…choose the customer and payment — cash, MoMo, or add it to the student's fee bill — and complete the sale.

49
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:10,810
Plan the weekly menu, track kitchen stock, and watch daily income and best sellers.

50
00:07:15,045 --> 00:07:22,093
The store tracks uniforms, books and supplies, with low-stock alerts and purchase orders.

51
00:07:22,243 --> 00:07:29,682
The library manages the catalogue, loans and returns, and works out overdue fines automatically.

52
00:07:29,832 --> 00:07:35,841
Transport manages buses, routes, drivers and riders, trips and maintenance.

53
00:07:35,991 --> 00:07:41,255
For boarding schools: halls, bed allocation and exeats.

54
00:07:41,405 --> 00:07:48,170
And health and discipline records keep every infirmary visit and incident on file.

55
00:07:53,343 --> 00:08:02,883
Gate Attendance shows who has arrived this morning, who is late, and who has not come in yet — for students and staff.

56
00:08:03,033 --> 00:08:07,531
At the entrance, a tablet runs the gate kiosk.

57
00:08:07,681 --> 00:08:17,219
It shows a QR code that changes every thirty seconds. Students and staff scan it with their phone to clock in and out.

58
00:08:17,369 --> 00:08:36,810
Pupils without phones hold up their ID badge to the kiosk camera. Their photo appears so the security officer can confirm it is really them — and the parent gets a text.

59
00:08:39,493 --> 00:08:47,956
This is Mr. Kwame Asante's portal: his lessons for today, work to mark, and a reminder to take the register.

60
00:08:48,106 --> 00:08:55,843
He clocks in by scanning the gate code — or typing the six-digit code shown on the kiosk.

61
00:08:55,993 --> 00:09:02,010
His arrival time is recorded, and late arrivals are flagged automatically.

62
00:09:05,575 --> 00:09:14,064
Teachers can teach live, with camera, microphone, screen sharing and chat. Each class has its own code and invite link.

63
00:09:14,214 --> 00:09:26,237
Before starting, check the camera and microphone, and choose low-data or audio-only mode for slow connections.

64
00:09:26,387 --> 00:09:33,805
Students join with the class code or invite link. Here, Kofi has just joined from his phone.

65
00:09:33,955 --> 00:09:41,090
Students can raise a hand, chat, and turn their camera or microphone off at any time.

66
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:53,930
The teacher can mute everyone, lock microphones or cameras, remove a student, and end the class for all. Attendance is saved automatically.

67
00:09:58,194 --> 00:10:07,510
Mrs. Akosua Mensah has two children in the school. Her portal shows each child's attendance, average and fees owing.

68
00:10:07,660 --> 00:10:14,772
She can see their results for every term and download the report card.

69
00:10:14,922 --> 00:10:33,700
And she can pay school fees with Mobile Money, right from her phone.

70
00:10:33,850 --> 00:10:40,290
She can also check the school bus route and stops, and the canteen menu.

71
00:10:43,465 --> 00:10:50,160
Kofi's own portal shows today's lessons, homework due, quizzes and his results.

72
00:10:50,310 --> 00:11:16,045
He can take a quiz on his phone, with a timer, and see his score straight away.

73
00:11:16,195 --> 00:11:21,610
He can browse the library catalogue and check his borrowed books.

74
00:11:24,786 --> 00:11:33,462
Every staff member gets a portal built for their job. The librarian sees overdue books and fines.

75
00:11:33,612 --> 00:11:39,207
The storekeeper sees stock value and the reorder list.

76
00:11:39,357 --> 00:11:44,866
The transport officer sees every route, bus and rider.

77
00:11:45,016 --> 00:11:52,450
And support staff — drivers, security, cleaners and cooks — can clock in and read school notices.

78
00:11:57,520 --> 00:12:03,823
The Super Admin sets up the system for each school: name, logo and colours.

79
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:10,950
Choose a colour theme, and the whole app changes instantly.

80
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:18,119
Modules a school does not use — like hostel or canteen — can be switched off.

81
00:12:18,269 --> 00:12:24,204
Login and security controls password rules, verification codes, parent sign-up and account lockout.

82
00:12:24,354 --> 00:12:28,850
And the Users tab approves new parent accounts and resets passwords.

83
00:12:34,415 --> 00:12:40,615
EduNexa keeps working even when the internet goes off.

84
00:12:40,765 --> 00:12:51,150
The orange bar shows we are offline — but every page still opens, and all your work is saved on the device.

85
00:12:51,300 --> 00:13:01,729
Text messages sent while offline wait in a queue…

86
00:13:01,879 --> 00:13:07,250
…and go out automatically as soon as the connection returns.

87
00:13:10,710 --> 00:13:17,008
On a phone, EduNexa looks and feels like an app, with a bottom menu.

88
00:13:17,158 --> 00:13:24,175
Install it: on iPhone, Safari, Share, Add to Home Screen. On Android, Chrome menu, Install app.

89
00:13:24,325 --> 00:13:30,810
Then it opens straight from the home screen — even without data.
